DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260722T150000
UID:697100d291e4576f847dd9ae@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:An aging silent film queen refuses to accept that her stardom 
 has ended. She hires a young screenwriter to help set up her movie comebac
 k. The screenwriter believes he can manipulate her\, but he soon finds out
  he is wrong. The screenwriters ambivalence about their relationship and h
 er unwillingness to let go leads to a situation of violence\, madness\, an
 d death.\nAges 12+ (No official rating)\n1 Hour 50 Minutes
LOCATION:Cedarbrae\, FCCR (First-Floor Auditorium)
