DESCRIPTION:Enjoy some light refreshments\, and informal discussion about 
 services in the neighbourhood. Get to know your local library staff and le
 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nEach month we will be joined by a different 
 community organization. Upcoming guests at Lillian H. Smith branch:\nApril
 : **guest has cancelled\, event will still run** YES (Youth Employment Se
 rvices)\nMay: Toronto Elections\nJune: Asian Community AIDS Services - BIP
 OC Harm Reduction program *please note: date has changed to June 19*\nSna
 cks and refreshments are provided for all participants. Ingredient lists w
 ill be available at the program.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Room B/C
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/695d7436f21d1d99bcda1b34
