UID:6a06018646d5f64f7dcbb5c7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Greetings citizens of the Union of Aligned Planets! Do you loo
 k good in red? Have you made an up-to-date\, legally binding last will and
  testament? Then the SPACE CADET corps is for you! Join us for a fun and e
 xciting RPG run-through of 'Space Cadets of the Stellar Rangers' campaign 
 inspired by the RPG\, Goblin Quest! Hosted in partnership with the Friend
 s of the Merril Collection.\nA morning and an afternoon session will be of
 fered. Please only register for one session. This program is for adults ag
 e 18 and up.\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the To
 ronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20
 (c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program 
