 y design tool that lets anyone create pro-quality graphics\, social posts\
 , and printables in minutes—no skills required!\nPLEASE NOTE: After regi
 stering\, create a free Canva account at\nwww.canva.com\nYou will need thi
 s account to sign into Canva during the class.\nPrerequisites\n: Mouse and
  keyboarding skills\, Canva Account\nLive or automated closed captioning\,
  sign language interpretation\, intervenor services\, or attendant service
 s are available upon request. Please submit your request at least 2 weeks 
 in advance to: tpl.ca/accessibility-events. ​​\nInformation Collectio
 n Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toron
