UID:693f0f5294297d36009feee7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join our book club for engaging discussions\, new book recomme
 ndations\, and a fun way to connect with fellow book lovers! Whether you'r
 e a lifelong reader or just getting started\, we welcome all to share thei
 r thoughts and dive into exciting reads together.\nHere are the upcoming m
 eeting dates and titles:\nJune 20: The sleeping car porter\nJuly 18: The
  Immoralist\nAugust 15: How it all began\nSeptember 19: Bobbi Lee: India
 n Rebel\nOctober 17: Me before you\nNovember 21: The Riveter\nDecember 19:
  More than enough\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informatio
 n on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public
  Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will 
 only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation.
  Questions about how the library handles your information can be directed 
 to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Str
 eet\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Weston\, Youth Hub Area. Main Floor.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/693f0f5294297d36009feee7
