 he intersection of politics with sci-fi and fantasy\, and how authors of s
 peculative fiction navigate writing dystopian and cautionary tales when th
 e present threatens to eclipse fiction. Sponsored by the Writers Union of
  Canada and Canada Council.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal 
