BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Toronto Games Week: Journalling for Your Games and Creative Work
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260611T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260611T190000
UID:6a0dfc81748daf857d593fb5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:There are many challenges to bring a project to life\, includi
 ng in technical\, creative\, and business processes. Join Tanya Kan from t
 he game studio Vivid Foundry in a journalling workshop to reflect on your 
 goals and priorities. Whether you’re working on a 1-month art piece or a
  4-year game\, let’s be motivated in our human-first creative journey!\n
 Registration required. More information via link at\nTorontoGamesWeek.com/
 schedule
LOCATION:Fort York\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0dfc81748daf857d593fb5
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
