UID:6995067e81b67dfe32a70be5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:If you are a newcomer to Canada and want to enhance your Engli
 sh communication skills\, this program is for you and it is FREE!\nThis pr
 ogram is in partnership with WoodGreen Community Services.\nThe personal 
 information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under 
 the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The informa
 tion will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and e
