 Storm Reid\, Ken Leung and Nia Long. Directed by Nicholas D. Johnson and
  Will Merrick.\nRated: PG-13. Length:1h 51m.\n*Subtitles for the Deaf and 
 Hard of Hearing (SDH) when available
