 ooks in a friendly and social atmosphere.\nJune Book Title:\nHome\n: A Me
 moir of My Early Years by Julie Andrews\nJuly Book Title:\nKnots and Cros
 ses\nby Ian Rankin\nTo get a copy of the book\, please visit the 1st floor
  desk at Albert Campbell Library. New members are always welcome.\nDrop-in
  or register for a reminder at 416-396-8890 or speak to staff at the desk.
