  procedure. First\, participants must complete their registration through 
 this page. After this step\, library staff will follow up to request addit
 ional information in order to complete the registration.\nInformation Coll
 ection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the 
 Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 2
