DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260612T113000
UID:6a16289a90cc4e3a7909335b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Following the storytime program on Fri June 12\, we will host
  a parenting workshop at Morningside library.\nPost-storytime\, we will 
 be joined by a Toronto Public Health (TPH) nurse\, who will provide infor
 mation on managing stress in parents or guardians\, & more! TPH will also
  answer any of your questions\, relating to parenting and health & wellnes
 s.\nPlease note: this workshop is intended for parents\, guardians\, or 
 caregivers of children ages 0-6 years old!
